e_ether_05_62","text":"I guess the experiment must've been pretty painful for you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_shapeofhope","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_63","text":"And yet here you are, still worrying about those Nikkes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_64","text":"Is this all just an act... hypocrisy... or are you really just a sucker?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_65","text":"Should I say you've got strong mental grit... or just a sign that you haven't got much upstairs?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_66","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_66","text":"Ether.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_67","text":"They're all cured now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_68","text":"Thanks to someone who worked real hard as my test subject, I managed to make a cure for Nikkes, too.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_69","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_69","text":"There won't be any retaliation against them, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_70","text":"Retaliation? Seriously? You really think I'm gonna take my anger out on those Nikkes or something?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_71","text":"*Sigh* You make me sound like some kind of slave driver.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_72","text":"Those Nikkes are company property, and I'm just a regular employee here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_73","text":"Just 'cause I'm pissed off doesn't mean I can go around killing them on a whim.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_74","text":"I'm just following the research lab's rules and procedures to get the job done.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_75","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_75","text":"If that procedure means getting rid of the Nikkes, would you still go through with it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_76","text":"If a Mind Switch occurs during the experiment, they'll be disposed of. Otherwise, they'll survive.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_77","text":"Even if it's not caused by this experiment,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_78","text":"Nikkes who undergo a Mind Switch don't survive. You know that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_79","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_79","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_80","text":"Okay, we're done here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_81","text":"Let's go. I'll walk you out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_82","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_82","text":"Ether.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_83","text":"Huh?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_84","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_84","text":"Thanks for treating me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_85","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_86","text":"Here we are, at the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"City","bgArt":"city","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_backtonormal","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_87","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_87","text":"!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_88","type":"Monologue","speaker":"Monologue","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_88","text":"It's been a long time since I last breathed the air in the Ark...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_89","type":"Monologue","speaker":"Monologue","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_89","text":"... It feels so refreshing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_90","text":"So, how's it feel to be freed from being a test subject?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["ether"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_91","text":"Must be nice to get some fresh air, huh?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_92","type":"Monologue","speaker":"Monologue","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_92","text":"I nod.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_93","text":"Always remember the happiness that comes from this freedom and peace.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_94","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_94","text":"Just live like everyone else. Even if you know the truth, pretend you don't.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_95","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_95","text":"Don't go poking around where you shouldn't.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_96","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_96","text":"That's the only way to survive in this hypocritical paradise.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_97","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_97","text":"...","jump":"d_nikke_ether_05_99","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_98","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_98","text":"I refuse.","jump":"d_nikke_ether_05_101","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_99","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_99","text":"Why won't you answer?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_100","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_100","text":"Are you saying you can't agree? Or that you can't deny it?","jump":"d_nikke_ether_05_103","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_101","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_101","text":"Wow, you're so resolute.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_102","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_102","text":"You really never change, do you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_103","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_103","text":"... Someday, people will come to know what's beneath their feet.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_104","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_104","text":"Humans? No way, they'll just keep living their lives, none the wiser.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_105","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_105","text":"No secret lasts forever.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_106","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_106","text":"Well... Even if it's no longer a secret,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_107","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_107","text":"do you think people would care even a little?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_108","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_108","text":"They'd just see it as no different from sending Nikkes to the surface or the research lab.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_109","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_109","text":"Even if they think it's ethically wrong, they'd just call it a necessary evil.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_110","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_110","text":"Most would turn a blind eye to the filth under their feet just to keep enjoying this peaceful life.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_111","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_111","text":"There's got to be someone who wouldn't ignore it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_112","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_112","text":"Someone like you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_113","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_113","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_114","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_114","text":"No. 7. You know,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_115","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_115","text":"I hope next time it's you who catches an incurable disease on the surface.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_116","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_116","text":"When your life doesn't mean much anymore, when you can't use suicide as a threat against me anymore,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_117","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_117","text":"will your sense of justice still be strong enough to overcome basic human instinct?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_118","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_118","text":"Will you still think of this as a necessary evil?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_119","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_119","text":"I'm really curious about your answer.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_120","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_120","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_121","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_121","text":"Take care, No. 7.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_122","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_122","text":"Let's meet again when you're carrying a deadlier disease and on the brink of an irreversible death,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_123","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_123","text":"my righteous lab rat.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_124","type":"Monologue","speaker":"Monologue","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_124","text":"Ether turns away from me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_125","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_125","text":"Oh, right! I almost forgot again.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_126","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_126","text":"There's something I forgot to give you last time.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_127","type":"Monologue","speaker":"Monologue","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_127","text":"Ether throws me a slip of paper.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_128","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_128","text":"What's this?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ether_05_129","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ether_05_129","text":"Okay, goodbye for real this time.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":n